#. Out of memory error message with help instruction.
#. Message written in Pango text markup language,
#. A carriage return makes a line break, <tt> tag makes a monospace font
#: src/scanner.vala:1385
msgid ""
"Insufficient memory to perform scan.\n"
"Try to decrease <tt>Resolution</tt> or <tt>Page Size</tt> in "
"<tt>Preferences</tt> menu. For some scanners when scanning in high "
"resolution, the scan size is restricted."
msgstr ""
"For lite minne til å utføre skanning.\n"
"Prøv å redusere <tt>Oppløysing</tt> eller <tt>Sidetal</tt> i "
"<tt>Innstillingar</tt> — menyen. For enkelte skannarar er skannstorleiken "
"avgrensa når du skannar med høg oppløysing."

